modes from codeberg.org/dwl/dwl-patches (modes.patch, dwl v0.8), config.def.h
hunks stripped -- the enum, modes_labels[] and modekeys[] live in our config.h.
Local changes vs upstream patch: printstatus no longer indexes modes_labels[-1]
in NORMAL mode (out-of-bounds read), and modekeybinding compares keysyms
case-insensitively like keybinding() does, so MOD_SHIFT chords match.

--- a/dwl.c
+++ b/dwl.c
